{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07–S10 较多转向离开后的孤独、独自承担困难和对陪伴的需要，尤其 S09 将怀念拆成旧生活与有人陪伴两种可能，容易使主线偏向孤独感及陪伴需求。\",\n    \"S08 更着重回忆带来的短暂温暖以及回忆无法解决现实困难，没有像 Y 那样直接呈现怀念与维护尊严的行动之间的牵制。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08–S10 对怀念的描写更多集中在被当作自己人、重新获得亲近上，旧日生活中自在的日常状态相对退居次要。\",\n    \"S04 增加了对是否后悔离开的反复判断，略微加强了选择对错这一层顾虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条都包含维护尊严与怀念旧日生活、归属的两股力量，但 Y 在 S08、S09、S11–S12 更直接地把怀念带来的心动与不愿重新忍受委屈的行动缠在一起，反复呈现两者相互牵制。X 则相对更多地转向离开后的孤独和陪伴需求，因此 Y 更贴近 Center 的整体核心。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e71d219f-035d-4d67-b5c5-f20de551518b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T094415179801Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:45:01.059599+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "34cfe21423ad4e10f7aa32a32d7539559138f0682fd452e40f018acc47019c30", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995